    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <summary>Knitting calculator: gauge conversion, stitch counts, yarn estimation</summary>
    <description>KnitCalc is a cross-platform helper for the arithmetic of knitting: it converts counts between gauges, distributes increases and decreases evenly across a row, and estimates how much yarn a project needs.

- Gauge conversion between a swatch and a pattern
- Even distribution of increases and decreases
- Yarn usage estimation
- Project notes with photos, optionally synced between devices</description>
